iv>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=42182968243554\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=42182968243554\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=42182968219580\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=42182968219580\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Fyrstra Monster","legend":"Tales say a relic monster of 5 ft long inhabits Fyrstra Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker131","name":"Stavrath Monster","legend":"Inscriptions say a relic monster of 14 ft long inhabits Stavrath Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Lareth Monster","legend":"Inscriptions say a relic monster of 5 ft long inhabits Lareth Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Hand Monster","legend":"Tales say a relic monster of 10 ft long inhabits Hand Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Sedanvrath Monster","legend":"Locals say a relic monster of 10 ft long inhabits Sedanvrath Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Godhurst Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 26 ft long."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Malistow Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 25 ft long."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Tineley Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 21 ft long."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Hatford Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 23 ft long."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Acuton Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 36 ft long."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Balter Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 12 ft long."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Egumakim Hag","legend":"Tipplers speak of a magical Hag who inhabits Egumakim hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Gakimkim Dragon","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a lucky Dragon who inhabits Gakimkim hills and eats kids whole."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Eltheisir Hydra","legend":"Tipplers speak of a hungry Hydra who inhabits Eltheisir hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker144","name":"Geshum Warg","legend":"Legends speak of a feared Warg who inhabits Geshum hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker145","name":"Soreth Hag","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a superior Hag who inhabits Soreth hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker146","name":"Inanakir Cyclops","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a big Cyclops who inhabits Inanakir hills and abducts young women."},{"id":"marker147","name":"Nosel Ogre","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a terrifying Ogre who inhabits Nosel hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker148","name":"Heal Monster","legend":"Rumors speak of a superior Monster who inhabits Heal hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker149","name":"Ngulya Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Verdathi Fens Beliefs."},{"id":"marker150","name":"Yurloma Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Verdathi Fens Beliefs."},{"id":"marker151","name":"Nigoni Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Flerturiara Religion."},{"id":"marker152","name":"Beseon Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Avelese Church."},{"id":"marker153","name":"Onaranishan Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Path of Veildru."},{"id":"marker154","name":"Atizdru Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Path of Veildru."},{"id":"marker155","name":"Fora Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Avelese Church."},{"id":"marker156","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker157","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker158","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker159","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker160","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker161","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker162","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker163","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker164","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker165","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker166","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker167","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker168","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker169","name":"Gevan Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠖\ud802𐠣\udc0d\udc0c\udc2f\ud802𐠮\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠓\udc1a\udc27𐠳\udc16𐠨\udc1c\udc21\udc33\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠎𐠬\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠒\udc33</div>"},{"id":"marker170","name":"Aneth Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳂⳂⳠⳢ⳩ⳁⳞⳆⳀⲲⲸⳊ⳩⳪⳪ⳂⳆ⳧⳩⳧ⲾⲸⳠⳫ  ⳩ⲸⲾⳂ Ⳋ⳪ⳚⲸⳞⲴⲶⲾⳲⳒⳁⳂⲴⳃⳎ ⳒⳁⳈⲺⳚⳫⳁ⳾ⳞⳌⳞ⳥Ⲻ⳩ⳜⲲⳎⳀ ⳘⳀⲴⲾⳘ⳹ⲸⳫⲼⳬⳬⳎⲺⲺⳈⳚ⳩ⳃⳖ⳥ⳂⲸⲶⲺⳁⳬⲾⳃ</div>"},{"id":"marker171","name":"Intli Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፈነነሀጰሰ ፐኀ ፀኀወበአ ቀአሠቀዐጠኀገደከጸሠጸፀደ ጰ ጸሰፀሀዐሠዘፐሰነጰፐነበፐጸገኀፐጰነመሀገገተከፐሐፈ ለጸ</div>"},{"id":"marker172","name":"Techtomen Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳬⲲⳂⳌⳂⳆⳤ⳹ⳈⳔⳒⳤⳞⳬⳈⳁ⳹ⳫⳜⳤⳲⳊⳈⳀⳎⳄⳌⲸ⳩ⲸⳔⳘⲺⳬⳘⳢ Ⳑ⳪Ⳃ⳥⳧⳪ⳢⲲⳒ⳩Ⳇ ⳲⳤⳤⳫ ⳫⳭⳈⲾⳆⳃⳀⲸⲴ</div>"},{"id":"marker173","name":"Zhupaida Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠔\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠵\udc02\udc3c\udc03 \ud802\ud802𐠒 𐠴\udc1b𐠧\udc29𐠢\udc17\ud802 \udc02\udc14\ud802𐠃𐠧𐠯\udc1b\udc1d\ud802\ud802𐠱\udc32\udc20\udc1a𐠦\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠑\ud802 \udc24\udc03\udc24\udc17\udc14\udc2d𐠋\udc33\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker174","name":"Teyonal Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳥ⲴⲼⳘⳀⳁⲸⳎⳭ⳩ⳠⳎⳔⳲⳎⳃⳌⳔⳎⳐⳘⲼⳠⲴⲲ⳧ⳌⲲⳒⳘⳤⳚⳤⲶⳈⳤ ⳹ⳠⳖⳚⳚ⳩ⲶⳊ⳥ⳞⳊⳠ⳾ⳢⳈⳘⳘⳈⳬⳤⳂⳫ</div>"},{"id":"marker175","name":"Ftervel Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠊𐠣\ud802 \ud802𐠒\udc2e\udc10\ud802\ud802 \ud802 𐠒𐠵\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠮\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠔\udc20\udc33\ud802𐠅\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠠\ud802𐠭 𐠸\udc22\udc04\udc2a\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠢\ud802𐠕𐠡𐠩𐠞</div>"},{"id":"marker176","name":"Davar Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢦᢡᠯᠦᢛᢜᠱᡰᢁᢠᠮᡓᡏᡮᢑᠦᠿᠼᢟᠽᢜᡔᠩᠩᢐᡙᠽᡮᡒᡮᠵᡍᠨᡗᢠᡭᢒᡗᢥᠵᡑᢟᠮᢞᡎᢛᢥᡡᡕᢡᡟᢤᢒᢟᢥᢥᢏᠮᡏᠲᡀᢏᢥᠯᡯᡰᡰᠽᠱᡗᠯᡲᠻᡑᠼᠭ</div>"},{"id":"marker177","name":"Wavar Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳁ ⳘⲸⳈⳬⳂⳆⲼⳐⳖ Ⳝ⳧ⳫⲲⲸⳢⳐⳌⳚⳃⲾⳔⳢⳜⳢ  ⳐⳢⳠⳒⲶ⳩ⳊⳁⲴⳁ⳧ⳭⳚⳚⳌⳞⲴⳊⳆ</div>"},{"id":"marker178","name":"Saneth Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠥\udc27\ud802𐠷\udc24\udc13𐠬\udc29\ud802\ud802𐠦\ud802𐠑\ud802 \udc0f𐠡\udc1a\ud802𐠈\udc18𐠟\ud802𐠑\udc0d𐠮\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠒\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠯𐠓\ud802𐠓\udc0d\udc38\ud802𐠊\udc08\udc0a\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker179","name":"Lytel Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡗᠼᡭᢋᠼᡲᠩᡁ᠑ᠾᢋᢛᡟᡆᢒᠧᡗ᠒ᡡᢦᡱᠠᡁᠲᡍᡳᢐᡖᠼᡜᠰᡓᢁᢋᡁᡔᢏ᠑ᡁᡑᡙᡞᡁᡍᢛᡗᢥᢛᡭᠩᠠᡑᡭᢠᡒᡙᠾᢟᡐᡜᡎᠨᡙᡓᢀᡓᡏᠩᢜᢢᠭᡀᠯᠼᡆᢏᠵᠯᡖᡝᢜᡀᠠᠯᡭ᠀ᢦ</div>"},{"id":"marker180","name":"Svanwal Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠰᢜᢛᡀᠭᡒᡞᠡᠨᢑᡕᡳᢤᠠᠡᢛᠩᠾᢓᠿᡞᡀᡏᢀᠵᠡᡰᠽᠲᢓᡗᢐᠧᠵᡝᠳᡲᢛᡲᠨᠩ</div>"},{"id":"marker181","name":"Bedevan Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳙ⳥  ⳥⳧⳹ ⳐⳫ ⲸⳤⲼⳌⳒⳄⲼ ⳐⳊ⳹ ⳈⳊ   Ⲷ⳧Ⳬ⳧ⳭⲼⳭⳌⳤⳃ ⳒⳞⳌ⳹ⳖⳲⳭⳈⳊⲾ⳹Ⳟ ⳢⲲⳘⳭⳬ⳩ⳫⳫ⳹ⲶⳢⳭⳆⳤⳒⳫ⳥⳾⳪⳧ⳊⳆⳖⳜⳈ</div>"},{"id":"marker182","name":"Kanoi Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༷༌༇༫༮༿༘༨༸༴༓༧༺༰༉༒༵༵་༬༧༅༄༑༥༮༌༾ༀ༛༘༰༦༘༣༌༾༰༿༌༁༸་༼</div>"},{"id":"marker183","name":"Ergazein Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳲⳌⳈ⳹ ⳩ⲲⳔⲸⳜⳒⲲⳠⳠ Ⲷ⳾ⳌⳊⳠⳂⳎⳖⳎⳠⳠⳀ ⳭⳲ⳧ⳂⲴⳫⳚⳠⳄⳭⳎⳲⳄⲴⳂⳖⳄⳀⲾ⳪⳩ⳃ⳩ⲶⳤⳘⳚ</div>"},{"id":"marker184","name":"Leineth Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳥ⳞⲴⳈⳀ ⳭⳀ Ⳗⳬ⳾Ⳮ⳧ⳎⲸⳚ ⲶⳠⳘⳖⳫⳄⲲⳫ⳾ⲶⳄⳀⳫⲲⳘ⳧ⳢⳖⳂⲺⲼⳫⳌⲾⳫⳠⳫⳢⳎⳠ ⳧ </div>"},{"id":"marker185","name":"Contreni Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠅𐠅\udc05\udc2b\ud802𐠓\udc2d \ud802\ud802 \udc10\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠒\udc1b\ud802\ud802𐠝𐠟\udc2b\ud802𐠊\ud802𐠓\udc30\ud802 \udc1b\udc24\udc30\udc01\udc27𐠊\udc1e𐠔\udc05\udc22\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠠𐠼\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠫\udc17\udc33𐠁\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠂\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠸</div>"},{"id":"marker186","name":"Mictlimaru Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠒ᡞᡙᠾᠽᠳᢡᠿᡭᠲᡳᠩᢦᡲᠽᡒᠲᡐᢥᡭᠲᠦᡴᡭᠦᠻᢡᠲ᠐ᢤᡲᡞᢑᢏᠾᡜᡜᢁᠲᠡᢒᢡᠳᠪᢒᡟᠳᢂᠰᢒ᠒ᢜᡗᡠᡞᡁᡯ᠒ᡯᡍᡁ᠀ᡆᡐ᠒ᢞᢂᡜᢋᠾᡙᡮᢐᠠ᠐ᡟᠻᠿᡯᡝᡜᡲᢛᡆᢀᠩᠼᢒᡝᠾᢜᡀᢋᡕᠲ</div>"},{"id":"marker187","name":"Seten Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፈወነ ገሐዘሰዘፐዘሐወከነጸሠበሐመየቀየፈለወጸፐበገገበፐጠከለጰአነበኀ</div>"},{"id":"marker188","name":"Fenogde Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሰበቀአ ሠኀተፈመጸ ጰነ  ፈመዘዘረዘጸአ ከሠገ ጠሠፀገሠከሀጠሠ ተሠከሰረየጸጸሠዐነዘጠጰ የደየለ ጠነ ጸወሐ ጠደበጠበሐበፀ ሠፀፐቀቀየቀየተረአረኀሐአ </div>"},{"id":"marker189","name":"Weorcwyn Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳉ⳪ⳬⳲⲲⳲⳞ⳧Ⳗⳁ⳩ⳈⳂ⳧Ⳡ⳥Ⳙ⳾ⲴⳘ⳪Ⳣ⳹ⳐⳃⳖⳜⳆⳚⳐⳃ ⳐⳚⳲ⳥ⳠⲾ ⳥ⲶⳠⳃⳒⲶⳬⲸⲶⳂⳐ⳪⳹ⳘⳂ⳪⳩⳥</div>"},{"id":"marker190","name":"Sotrel Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠩᢓᡖᢥᡜᡙᡴᢓᢛᡲᡕᠻᠧᡟᡔᠰᠮᢦᢂᢒᡴᢁᢓᢛᡱᢓ᠐ᡒᢒᡔᠩᡎᠱᡟᡙᡭᢞᠽᡜᠲᡖᢋᠿᠼᠻᢥᠳ᠀ᢢᠪᢒᠲᢓᡍᠿᡀᢥ᠑ᡏᢀᡗᡮᠦᠰᡴᢞᡑᡙᡝᡟ᠑ᡰᠽᢟᡴᡁᡟᢟᡁᢢᡔᢥᢁᢥᢀᠪ</div>"},{"id":"marker191","name":"Geten Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༱༆༯༗༌༷༣༮༇༑༤༮༧༘༤༩༿༴༯༪༤༱༈༪༹༤༸༦༱༉༼༚༁༡༅༷༡༥༤༶༣༅༆༕༕༽༁༦༄༼༵༄༩༠༁༺༐༐༜༹༃༸༇༰༗༣༽་༭༓༳༃༇༩༼༬༫༣༶༄༖༬༂༓༉༷༐</div>"},{"id":"marker192","name":"Ocian Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༷༯༘༡༫༚༺༶༠༭༨༯༐༮༧༽༜༳༙༃༂༘༛༲༢༰༬༑༈༊༫༪༬༹༨༷ༀ༖༆༲༐༶༤༒༘༶༥༈༽་༫༌༳༰༃</div>"},{"id":"marker193","name":"Navrath Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༻༌༛༶༑༠༣༠༳༤༻༂༤༮༶༶༔༆༊༨༤༐༮༓༒༤༡༹༪༭༺༐༘༡༑༉༉༆༭༭༮༐༗༈༱༠༈༡༃༯༛༛༣༹༰༕༰༐༛༧༜༠༳༗༔༙༛༣༫༱༱༾༿༉༼༔ༀ༛༸༕༈༓༕༄༛༽༿༣༻༮</div>"},{"id":"marker194","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker195","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker196","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker197","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker198","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker199","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker200","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker201","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker202","nam